t("Telekinetic Smash", "Smash telequinético", "talent name")
t("You cannot do that without a weapon in your hands.", "No puedes hacer eso sin un arma en tus manos.", "logPlayer")
t("Augmentation", "Agotación", "talent name")
t("Warding Weapon", "arma de guerra", "talent name")
t("Impale", "Empalar", "talent name")
t("You cannot do that without a weapon in your telekinetic slot.", "No puedes hacerlo sin un arma en tu tragaperras telequinética.", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#%s shatters %s shield!", "¡Escudo!%s%s", "logSeen")

t("Gather your will, and brutally smash the target with your mainhand weapon and then your telekinetically wielded weapon, doing %d%% weapon damage.\n\t\tIf your mainhand weapon hits, you will also stun the target for %d turns.\n\t\tThis attack uses 60%% of your Willpower and Cunning instead of Strength and Dexterity to determine weapon damage and accuracy, for both attacks.\n\t\tAny active Aura damage bonusses will extend to the weapons used for this attack.", "Reúne tu voluntad, y aplasta brutalmente al objetivo con tu arma principal y luego tu arma empuñada telequinéticamente, haciendo %d%% de daño de arma.\\n\\t\\tSi tu arma principal golpea, también aturdirá al objetivo durante %d turnos.", "tformat")
t("While active, you give your flesh and blood body a boost in the form of precisely applied mental forces. Increases Strength and Dexterity by %d%% of your Willpower and Cunning, respectively.\n\t\tStrength increased by %d\n\t\tDexterity increased by %d", "Mientras estás activo, tú da a tu cuerpo de carne y sangre un impulso en la forma de fuerzas mentales aplicadas precisamente. Aumenta la fuerza y la destreza por %d %% de su Willpower y Astucia, respectivamente.\\nFuerza aumentada por %d\\nDexteridad aumentada por %d", "tformat")
t("Assume a defensive mental state.\n\t\tFor one turn, you will fully block the next melee attack used against you with your telekinetically-wielded weapon and then strike the attacker with it for %d%% weapon damage.\n\t\tAt talent level 3 you will also disarm the attacker for 3 turns.\n\t\tAt talent level 5 you will be able to reflexively block up to one attack per turn with a %d%% chance, based on your cunning. Each trigger requires and uses 10 Psi.\n\t\tThis requires a telekinetically-wielded weapon.", "Asume un estado mental defensivo.\\n\\t\\tDurante un turno, bloquearás completamente el siguiente ataque cuerpo a cuerpo usado contra ti con tu arma empuñada telequinéticamente y luego golpearás al atacante con ella por %d%% de daño de arma.\\n\\t\\tEl daño aumentará con tu Poder mental.", "tformat")
t("Focus your will into a powerful thrust of your telekinetically-wielded weapon to impale your target and then viciously rip it free.\n\t\tThis deals %d%% weapon damage and then causes the victim to bleed for %0.1f Physical damage over four turns.\n\t\tAt level 3 the thrust is so powerful that it has %d%% chance to shatter a random temporary magical or psionic damage absorbing shield if one exists.\n\t\tThe bleeding damage increases with your Mindpower.", "Enfoca tu voluntad en un poderoso empuje de tu arma empuñada telequinéticamente para empalar a tu objetivo y luego arrancarlo violentamente.\\n\\t\\tEsto inflige %d%% de daño de arma y desgarra al objetivo, reduciendo la curación en %d%% durante %d turnos.\\n\\t\\tEl daño y la reducción de curación aumentarán con tu Poder mental.", "tformat")
